    {
      "id": 10820,
      "category": "researcher",
      "content": "Application has a feature `Authorize your 3rd party stats` that provides users a way to generate `auth token` to track their statistics. The flaw was even if users deactivate their account `auth token` was not getting expired which allow third applications to track users statistics.",
